OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow thunderstorm warning is also n
OL,7,Fplace for England until 22:00 BST on
OL,8,FThursday, with Birmingham seeing heavy
OL,9,Fdownpours just before 08:00. But while
OL,10,Fthe EA has removed its flood warning in
OL,11,Fthe city, it says that standing water
OL,12,Fand debris could persist.
